WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,580 --> 00:00:02,780
Xiaotie, stop standing and come over to eat.

2
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:04,180
Your grandfather’s funeral

3
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:05,580
Let’s do it together in the village

4
00:00:06,330 --> 00:00:07,930
Uncle, this money

5
00:00:08,130 --> 00:00:09,930
This is a random gift from your grandfather's funeral.

6
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:11,330
You keep it, take it

7
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:13,330
You have a lot of money to live by yourself

8
00:00:13,530 --> 00:00:15,130
Besides, this is your family’s money.

9
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:16,330
Grandpa is really gone

10
00:00:16,530 --> 00:00:18,530
I'm the only one left in this family

11
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:23,740
Why did I come here?

12
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:24,940
I smashed this place

13
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,340
Why can't I remember anything?

14
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:28,900
Why is grandpa here?

15
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:30,500
Worship so many underground gods

16
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:32,900
Why am I kneeling here?

17
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:34,300
Am I not sleeping?

18
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:36,660
There's something playing with me here

19
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:37,860
I can't sleep anymore

20
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:39,780
what happened

21
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:45,070
Grandpa, am I dreaming?

22
00:00:46,310 --> 00:00:47,710
Xiaotie kneel down

23
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:50,580
Grandpa, grandpa, what's wrong with you?

24
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:54,830
Xiaotie, if you pick it up, you'll be safe.

25
00:00:55,360 --> 00:00:56,560
Grandpa will be fine

26
00:00:58,220 --> 00:00:59,420
What do you want me to pick up?

27
00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:01,420
Why is this black cloth clinging to me?

28
00:01:05,930 --> 00:01:07,730
Uncle, what should I do now? I'm scared.

29
00:01:07,930 --> 00:01:10,530
Is it because your grandfather is dead and unwilling to leave?

30
00:01:11,060 --> 00:01:12,260
I know a charlatan

31
00:01:12,260 --> 00:01:13,260
Take you there to see

32
00:01:13,460 --> 00:01:15,260
The starting price is 100. The cost of doing things is extra.

33
00:01:15,460 --> 00:01:16,460
Do you still have money in your hand?

34
00:01:16,460 --> 00:01:18,460
Yes, uncle, when should we go?

35
00:01:18,860 --> 00:01:20,860
I'll ride an electric bike and ask you to go there early tomorrow morning

36
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:23,360
Whatever that black cloth is

37
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:24,760
I have to figure it all out
